{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.rinze.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "课后的练习室",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.rinze.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.rinze.second",
    "idolId": "rinze",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……老师，刚才的地方……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……是，手臂再……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "谢谢您……今天，就到这里了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（今天也认真练习啊，认真得有点过头了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "辛苦了，凛世。最近进步很大啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "制作人大人……您，有在看吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "都是托制作人大人的指导。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，因为凛世很认真地完成课题，安排日程也有意义。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "不，不是什么值得夸奖的事……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不只是这样，社长也夸了凛世的努力哦！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……是，今后也会精进。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？好像……没那么高兴？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "不，制作人大人高兴……那才是凛世的幸福。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（算是高兴了吧？可总觉得她对自己的兴趣很淡……）",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "制作人大人……？怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，怎么说呢……想问一下。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是。无论什么事。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "为什么接受了我的邀请？",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "有没有想试着做的工作？",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "别太勉强自己了。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "那是……制作人大人的话，把凛世，改变了……",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（\"带你走上最好的舞台\"——那句话，凛世一直……）",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（原来如此，凛世是觉得不能在这种程度松懈啊……）",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不愧是凛世。我也是把你带进这个世界的人，有责任。以最好的舞台为目标一起努力吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是。为了您，我会迈进。"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "只要是制作人大人期望的……凛世，不会拒绝……",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这样啊……谢谢。帮大忙了。不过……硬要说的话，有没有什么想做的？",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "凛世只要能，被制作人大人看着……那就……",
        "nextNodeId": "113"
      },
      "113": {
        "id": "113",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原、原来如此……好像被期待了呢。既然凛世这么说，我也会尽量陪着你。",
        "nextNodeId": "114"
      },
      "114": {
        "id": "114",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "呵呵……感激不尽。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "如果有不想做的工作，一定要跟我商量。我想尽量尊重凛世的意见。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "勉强……不行的吧，那种事……",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "无论什么事都会接受……这个凛世，已经如此下定决心。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……奇怪地担心了，抱歉。有凛世这份觉悟，今后一定也会顺利。",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "是……"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
